---
title: "Session host: one channel across dcserver restarts, host loss and terminate"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Termination
    lg1: Session
    lg2: Breaks NoOrphanAfterTerminate or NoSessionLoss
    lg3: Path to the NoOrphanAfterTerminate or NoSessionLoss bug
  }
  class lg0 pink
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 breaks
  class lg3 bugPath
  s0: No session
  s1: No session, a message waiting
  s2: Creating, a message waiting
  s3: Created, location not yet recorded, a message waiting
  s4: Session up
  s5: End requested, provider running
  s6: Closing the session
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a message arrives
  s1 --> s2: a message reserves a new execution
  s2 --> s3: the host creates it
  s3 --> s4: its location is recorded and the turn starts
  s4 --> s4: a host probe stops failing
  s4 --> s5: an end is requested
  s5 --> s6: the close is sent
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 teal
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 teal
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 teal
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 teal
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 teal
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 pink
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 pink
  class s6 breaks
  class s6 bugPath
